{"unit_id":"loudMore__dsh-drop-to-path#card-zh","repo":"loudMore/dsh-drop-to-path","commit":"d938c1ddf14e86ddbad5e634f0118e6ace857668","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-drop-to-path（DSH Web 插件）：把拖放或粘贴的图片与文件转成工作区路径，供纯文本模型使用。图片保留原生附件预览，发送时上传并转成路径；PDF、Office、文本、压缩包、视频和音频显示为可移除标签，发送时附加路径。文件保存到工作区 .drops/。适合希望在 DSH Web 中向文本模型发送截图或文件的用户；无需额外密钥或账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:247-327","lib/client.js:329-381","lib/index.js:81-143"]}
{"unit_id":"loudMore__dsh-drop-to-path#card-en","repo":"loudMore/dsh-drop-to-path","commit":"d938c1ddf14e86ddbad5e634f0118e6ace857668","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-drop-to-path is a DSH Web plugin that converts pasted or dropped images and files into workspace paths for text-only models. Images retain native previews; other files appear as removable tiles. On send, uploads go to workspace .drops/ and paths join the message. No key or account needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:247-327","lib/client.js:329-381","lib/index.js:81-143"]}
